<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">obsidian-edge-resin</ansi> (alchemy recipe)

A jar of black volcanic resin, glassy and warm, that never quite
finishes setting no matter how long it sits corked on a shelf. Run a
blade's edge through it and the resin clings, half-liquid, as though
still deciding what shape to take. Whatever it seals stays a little
unfinished too -- an edge that keeps wanting to be sharper than it
already is.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       alchemy (minimum 50)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     alchemy_bench
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> Pine Pitch (x2), Coal Dust (x1), Blood-moss (x1)

